---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import { getProfile } from '../../lib/content';
const p = getProfile();
---
<Section id="about" title="About">
  <p>
    I am an undergraduate in Computer Engineering at UFPel and a research fellow in two
    groups: Tech&AppliedD-GM, where the Q-Flex subgroup works on quantum computing and
    fuzzy logic, and ViTech, where the work is deep learning and computer vision.
  </p>
  <p>
    What connects the two is a preference for building the thing rather than importing it.
    The projects below are mostly implementations from first principles &mdash; a physics
    engine, a neural network, a numerical integrator &mdash; because writing the equations
    out is what makes their failure modes visible. When a project claims a result here,
    that result was measured, and the number is on the page.
  </p>
  <p>
    Research interests: {p.interests.join(', ').toLowerCase()}.
  </p>
</Section>
